│   │   ├── relu.mlir
│   │   └── invalid.mlir
│   ├── Passes/
│   │   └── lower-to-linalg.mlir
│   └── Targets/RISCV/
│       └── lower-to-rvv.mlir
└── unit/
    ├── CMakeLists.txt
    └── Dialect/
        └── KernelOpsTest.cpp
```

## Test Requirements

| Change | Required Tests |
|--------|---------------|
| New operation | Parse/print, verifier, lowering |
| New pass | Transformation, edge cases |
| Bug fix | Regression test |
